        "text": "Hey Xi, what are you building? We are building a cross chain facility that would be like asset portal for Sonala. Like new users who onboard into Sonala who have assets but they don't have Sol on Solana to conduct the transactions. They can use value router to create one transaction that can route their assets directly into Solana. Solana with the best price on the market. Is this like native swaps? Yes, just like Lithium swap. Any asset will be swapped into usdc then bridged to Solana and then swap into to Seoul. Super cool. How can I get started? You can access the valuerouter.com to follow the DAPP instructions.",
